
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Dhudabhai Accounting - Accounting, bookkeeping and tax compliance support.">
  <title>Dhudabhai Accounting | Trusted Business Support</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #203047;
      line-height: 1.6;
      background: #f7f9fc;
    }
    header {
      background: #102b46;
      color: white;
      padding: 18px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    header h2 { margin: 0; }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 16px;
    }
    .hero {
      padding: 80px 7%;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #102b46, #176b67);
      color: white;
    }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px); max-width: 700px; line-height: 1.15; }
    .hero p { max-width: 620px; font-size: 18px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e5b95c;
      color: #172b40;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    section { padding: 55px 7%; }
    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 18px #102b4610;
    }
    .card h3 { color: #176b67; }
    .about { background: white; }
    .contact { background: #eaf1f5; }
    footer {
      background: #102b46;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px 7%;
      text-align: center;
    }
    a:focus { outline: 2px solid #e5b95c; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h2>Dhudabhai Accounting</h2>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <h1>Reliable Accounting for Your Business</h1>
      <p>
        Helping businesses stay organised with accounting,
        bookkeeping and tax compliance support.
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="#contact">Contact Us</a>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <h2>Our Services</h2>
      <p>Business support tailored to your accounting needs.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Bookkeeping</h3>
          <p>Organising income, expenses and financial records.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>GST Support</h3>
          <p>GST record preparation and return filing assistance,
          subject to applicable authorisation.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Tax Support</h3>
          <p>Tax documentation and compliance assistance.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Business Accounts</h3>
          <p>Financial summaries and routine accounting support.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
      <h2>About Dhudabhai Accounting</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to make accounting simpler, clearer and more
        organised for individuals and businesses.
      </p>
      <p>
        Contact us to discuss your requirements and the services
        we can provide.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Business name: Dhudabhai Accounting</p>
      <p>Phone: Add your business phone number</p>
      <p>Email: Add your business email address</p>
      <p>Location: Add your business address</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Dhudabhai Accounting. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
